              "id": "25404323"
            }
          ],
          "value": "Several alleles exist that vary in length, this is allele 3; alleles 1, 2 and 3 generate cross-bactericidal antibodies. About 50% of hypervirulent serogroup B N.meningitidis encode this protein (PubMed:12045242). This is the variant used in the 4CMenB (Bexsero) vaccine (PubMed:25404323). This is the variant used in the 5CVMB vaccine (PubMed:16825336)"
        }
      ],
      "commentType": "BIOTECHNOLOGY"
